sequence Render a file with the CLI
// From: src/cli.ts:986,1025,1046,1128,1150,1171,1225; src/render.ts:185,259,275,415; src/svg-to-png.ts:25
autonumber

User -dgmo diagram.dgmo-> main
main -read file and parse flags-> main
main -parseDgmo-> Parse router
Parse router -diagnostics-> main
main -render-> render
render -choosePalette-> Palettes
render -parseDgmo and category-> Parse router
render -renderForExport or renderDataChartD3-> Chart engine
Chart engine -SVG string-> render
render -SVG and diagnostics-> main
note right of main
  On any error diagnostic main swaps
  the SVG for renderErrorCard.
main -svgToPng-> resvg
resvg -PNG bytes-> main
main -write file-> Disk
